Package: yd-tools-vala
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, zenity, xclip
Description: Yandex.Disk indicator for the desktop panel
 The application indicator is displayed within the indicator plugin.
 It uses the Yandex.Disk CLI synchronization utility and shows the current
 status, disk sizes, last synchronized items and on-screen notifications when
 the status changes.
 .
 Settings, user icons and the single-instance lock are kept in
 ~/.config/yd-tools, so only one indicator is shown in the panel.
 .
 This project is a rewrite of yandex-disk-indicator by Sly_tom_cat
 (https://github.com/slytomcat/yandex-disk-indicator), produced with the
 assistance of a neural network.
